\li2 \rb Jeuel|יְעוּאֵ֑ל\rb* \rb and 690|שֵׁשׁ־\rb*\rb |מֵא֥וֹת\rb*\rb |וְתִשְׁעִֽים׃\rb* \rb relatives|וַאֲחֵיהֶ֖ם\rb*.
\b 
\li1 \v 7 \rb From|וּמִן־\rb* \rb the Benjamites|בְּנֵ֖י\rb*\rb |בִּנְיָמִ֑ן\rb*:
\li2 \rb Sallu|סַלּוּא֙\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Meshullam|מְשֻׁלָּ֔ם\rb*, \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Hodaviah|הוֹדַוְיָ֖ה\rb*, \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Hassenuah|הַסְּנֻאָֽה׃\rb*;
\li2 \v 8 \rb Ibneiah|וְיִבְנְיָה֙\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Jeroham|יְרֹחָ֔ם\rb*;
\li2 \rb Elah|וְאֵלָ֥ה\rb* \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of Uzzi|עֻזִּ֖י\rb*, \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Michri|מִכְרִ֑י\rb*;
\li2 \rb Meshullam|וּמְשֻׁלָּם֙\rb* \rb son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Shephatiah|שְׁפַטְיָ֔ה\rb*, \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Reuel|רְעוּאֵ֖ל\rb*, \rb the son|בֶּן־\rb* \rb of Ibnijah|יִבְנִיָּֽה׃\rb*;
\li2 \v 9 \rb and 956|תְּשַׁ֥ע\rb*\rb |מֵא֖וֹת\rb*\rb |וַחֲמִשִּׁ֣ים\rb*\rb |וְשִׁשָּׁ֑ה\rb* \rb of their relatives|וַאֲחֵיהֶם֙\rb* \rb according to their genealogy|לְתֹ֣לְדוֹתָ֔ם\rb*. \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb these|אֵ֣לֶּה\rb* \rb men|אֲנָשִׁ֔ים\rb* \rb were heads|רָאשֵׁ֥י\rb* \rb of their families|אָב֖וֹת\rb*\rb |לְבֵ֥ית\rb*\rb |אֲבֹתֵיהֶֽם׃ס\rb*.
\b 
