\p \v 38 \rb All|כָּל־\rb* \rb these|אֵ֜לֶּה\rb* \rb men|אַנְשֵׁ֣י\rb* \rb of war|מִלְחָמָה֮\rb*, \rb arrayed|עֹדְרֵ֣י\rb* \rb for battle|מַעֲרָכָה֒\rb*, \rb came|בָּ֣אוּ\rb* \rb to Hebron|חֶבְר֔וֹנָה\rb* \rb fully|שָׁלֵם֙\rb* \rb determined|בְּלֵבָ֤ב\rb* \rb to make David|דָּוִ֖יד\rb* \rb king|לְהַמְלִ֥יךְ\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb*. \rb And|וְ֠גַם\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb the rest|שֵׁרִ֧ית\rb* \rb of the Israelites|יִשְׂרָאֵ֛ל\rb* \rb were of one|אֶחָ֖ד\rb* \rb mind|לֵ֥ב\rb* \rb to make David|דָּוִֽיד׃\rb* \rb king|לְהַמְלִ֥יךְ\rb*.
